aration of Independence</i></div></div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Les,\"Declaraci\u00f3n de Independencia\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lfr,\"La D\u00e9claration d'ind\u00e9pendance\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lbe-tarask,\"\u0414\u044d\u043a\u043b\u044f\u0440\u0430\u0446\u044b\u044f \u043d\u0435\u0437\u0430\u043b\u0435\u0436\u043d\u0430\u0441\u044c\u0446\u0456\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Ltok,\"jan li toki e ni: mi wile ala awen lon kulupu\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lde,\"Declaration of Independence\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Len-gb,\"Declaration of Independence\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lfa,\"\u0627\u0639\u0644\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0633\u062a\u0642\u0644\u0627\u0644\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lzh,\"\u7f8e\u56fd\u72ec\u7acb\u5ba3\u8a00\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lda,\"Declaration of Independence\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lja,\"\u30a2\u30e1\u30ea\u30ab\u72ec\u7acb\u5ba3\u8a00\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lru,\"\u0414\u0435\u043a\u043b\u0430\u0440\u0430\u0446\u0438\u044f \u043d\u0435\u0437\u0430\u0432\u0438\u0441\u0438\u043c\u043e\u0441\u0442\u0438\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lsk,\"Trumbull\u2019s Declaration of Independence\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lhy,\"\u0531\u0576\u056f\u0561\u056d\u0578\u0582\u0569\u0575\u0561\u0576 \u0570\u057c\u0579\u0561\u056f\u0561\u0563\u056b\u0580\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lnb,\"Uavhengighetserkl\u00e6ringen\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lnl,\"Onafhankelijkheidsverklaring\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lit,\"Dichiarazione d'Indipendenza\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lcy,\"Datganiad Annibyniaeth\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lid,\"Deklarasi Kemerdekaan (Trumbull)\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lko,\"\ub3c5\ub9bd\uc120\uc5b8\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Len,\"Declaration of Independence\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lar,\"\u0625\u0639\u0644\u0627\u0646 \u0627\u0644\u0627\u0633\u062a\u0642\u0644\u0627\u0644\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lcs,\"Deklarace nez\u00e1vislosti\"</div><div style=\"display: none;\">label QS:Lca,\"Declaraci\u00f3 d'Independ\u00e8ncia\"</div></div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"CommonsMetadataExtension":{"value":1.2,"source":"extension","hidden":""},"Categories":{"value":"Declaration of Independence by John Trumbull|Images with annotations|PD-old-100-expired|Featured pictures on Wikipedia, English|PD-Art (PD-old-100-expired)|Commons featured widescreen desktop backgrounds|Artworks with Wikidata item|Artworks with known accession number|Images with extracted images|Featured pictures on Wikipedia, Hebrew|Featured pictures on Wikipedia, Spanish|Featured pictures on Wikipedia, Turkish|Images with 10+ annotations|CC-PD-Mark|Artworks with accession number from Wikidata|Files with coordinates missing SDC location of creation|Artworks digital representation of 2D work|Files with Assessments template missing SDC Commons no value quality assessment|Picture of week on the Malay Wikipedia","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"Assessments":{"value":"","source":"commons-categories","hidden":""},"GPSLatitude":{"value":"38.889722","source":"commons-desc-page"},"GPSLongitude":{"value":"-77.008889","source":"commons-desc-page"},"GPSMapDatum":{"value":"WGS-84","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Artist":{"value":"<bdi><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/en:John_Trumbull\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"w:en:John Trumbull\"><span title=\"American artist (1756\u20131843)\">John Trumbull</span></a></bdi>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"ImageDescription":{"value":"<a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/John_Trumbull\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:John Trumbull\">John Trumbull</a>'s painting, <i><a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Trumbull%27s_Declaration_of_Independence\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Trumbull's Declaration of Independence\">Declaration of Independence</a></i>, depicting the five-man drafting committee of the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Declaration_of_Independence_(United_States)\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:Declaration of Independence (United States)\">Declaration of Independence</a> presenting their work to the Congress. The painting can be found on the back of the U.S. <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Two_dollar_bill\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:United States Two dollar bill\">$2 bill</a>. The original hangs in the <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Capitol\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:United States Capitol\">US Capitol</a> <a href=\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/United_States_Capitol_rotunda\" class=\"extiw\" title=\"en:United States Capitol rotunda\">rotunda</a>. It does not represent a real ceremony; the characters portrayed were never in the same room at the same time.","source":"commons-desc-page"},"DateTimeOriginal":{"value":"1819<div style=\"display: none;\">date QS:P571,+1819-00-00T00:00:00Z/9</div>","source":"commons-desc-page"},"Credit":{"value":"US Capitol","source":"commons-desc-page"},"LicenseShortName":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"UsageTerms":{"value":"Public domain","source":"commons-desc-page"},"AttributionRequired":{"value":"false","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Copyrighted":{"value":"False","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"Restrictions":{"value":"","source":"commons-desc-page","hidden":""},"License":{"value":"pd","source":"commons-templates","hidden":""}}}]}}}}